  <body region="bottomCenter" style="s1">
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00:05.000" end="00:00:10.000">EN: Mara: Start the derived-file check at this marker.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:05.000.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:13.000" end="00:00:18.000">EN: Jules: Autoload should stay honest on reopen.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:13.000.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:21.000" end="00:00:26.000">EN: Mara: Match the subtitle beat to the burn-in.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:21.000.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:29.000" end="00:00:34.000">EN: Jules: Keep this file as the clean `Save As...` reference.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:29.000.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:37.000" end="00:00:42.000">EN: Mara: Log the result before moving to sound.<br/>Clock reads 00:00:37.000.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
